.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# NOTE: do not add a bare `data/` rule here. In the original monorepo that rule
# (meant for the Python scraper's snapshots) silently matched
# app/src/main/java/com/kira/followlens/data/ and kept the entire Room
# persistence layer out of version control.
